<tr><td>Security headers</td><td>HSTS only — see C3</td></tr>
<tr><td>Vercel hardening</td><td>Partial — see H4</td></tr>
<tr><td>Forms &amp; integrations</td><td>CTM + GTM + Maps — see C1, H1, H3</td></tr>
</table>
<hr/>
